        },
        "quote": "An exemption to the grease interceptor requirement may be requested by written application to the Authority Having Jurisdiction. This exception shall only apply to the remodeling of existing facilities where physical limitations make the installation of a gravity grease interceptor impractical. The written application for the exception shall contain the following conditions:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.340:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.35.340 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "4d13e695-d309-5878-9dd5-16d039b3955b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 584,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.340:block:2",
          "start": 461
        },
        "quote": "(1) The owner will install a testing manhole, meeting the requirements promulgated by the Water Pollution Control Division;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.340:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.35.340 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "9eb5d484-5f84-5e53-8834-70a1c4e54171",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 781,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.340:block:3",
          "start": 585
        },
        "quote": "(2) The owner will agree to pay for two random sample tests per year or the owner will agree to pay the cost of sewer line cleaning as deemed necessary by the Water Pollution Control Division; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.340:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.35.340 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "82a8972d-ab76-52e6-a899-016cb3b978e9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 996,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.340:block:4",
          "start": 782
        },
        "quote": "(3) The owner will install a grease interceptor, remove the fixture or fixtures, or cease operation if the grease exceeds the current limits or a significant grease problem develops downstream of the establishment.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.340:block:4#text",
